Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.06,0:02:16.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, CP9 should be here any second\Nnow.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.50,0:02:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.60,0:02:20.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll have to get on that train sooner or\Nlater.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.50,0:02:21.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.91,0:02:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take the lady and\Nget moving, you dimwits.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.41,0:02:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yes, sir!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.54,0:02:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A government rep,\Na bunch of marines and Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.10,0:02:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see, how should I play this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because inside of me,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.28,0:02:43.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(16,58,\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&H78&)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(17,433,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)\t(3978,4437,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}I carry a darkness that none of you know about.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.38,0:02:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.65,0:02:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're obviously\Nescorting her away.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But those guys are chumps,\Nif she wanted to run,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.69,0:02:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she could take\Nthem out, no problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.33,0:02:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She must be planning something we don't\Nknow about.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.26,0:03:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a reason why she's not\Nrunning.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.60,0:03:06.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you my darling!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.34,0:03:10.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my prince has\Ncome to rescue me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.64,0:03:12.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.65,0:03:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, you want me\Nto save you, Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.46,0:03:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Corgy, sir. CP9 is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop man handling me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This body is expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man that's Rob Lucci, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got the eyes of a killer!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.04,0:03:49.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd\Nsee CP9 in person.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.30,0:03:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you\Nto the count of ten,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.14,0:03:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and then it's gonna\Nget ugly! Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know who you're messing with!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.66,0:03:59.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got eight thousand men\Nhiding in the shadows
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just waiting to teach\Nyou losers a lesson!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.33,0:04:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep! They're gonna pop\Nout any minute now!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any minute, you hear me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better put me down quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll give\Nyou one last chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.01,0:04:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excellent work as\Nalways, sirs and madam!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, Mr. Lucci, your coat.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.18,0:04:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this, a parade?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.79,0:04:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's foolish.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.28,0:04:23.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.28,0:04:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't over until we reach\NEnies Lobby, so look sharp!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, board the\Nsea train immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard the man!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get on the train and make it quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.99,0:04:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you bastards\Ngonna put me down or...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:46.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are those\Nguys in the suits?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.30,0:04:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He says he's sorry for\Ncausing us so much trouble
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.73,0:04:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then he goes and gets\Nin trouble all over again.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A little further to the right!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spray over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.54,0:05:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring the hose this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.16,0:05:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you mean Robin\Ndoesn't hate us after all?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.33,0:05:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? He's a raccoon dog?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.07,0:05:11.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he was a reindeer!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did he just transform, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to find the rest\Nof the crew right away
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we can all go rescue Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.26,0:05:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, but where are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.21,0:05:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to find them!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.88,0:05:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now he's a gorilla!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you two.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you\Ngo after Nico Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but before you run off, you\Nshould know that the sea train
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.83,0:05:45.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for government personnel is\Ndeparting at 11 o'clock tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is just my guess
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's a good chance\Nyou'll find CP9 there.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.17,0:05:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that means Nico Robin will be there as\Nwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Aqua Laguna,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're stopping all service\Nafter this final departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:05:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.92,0:06:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you won't be able to chase\Nthem on another train.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean we have to...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.85,0:06:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since you obviously\Ncan't sail in this weather,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.19,0:06:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you won't be able to\Nleave the island
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.46,0:06:12.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,unless you go after\Nthat train right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.10,0:06:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.65,0:06:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Almost 10:30.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.44,0:06:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.44,0:06:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means we've only got half an hour\Nleft!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.41,0:06:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, but you're the mayor, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you do something to stop the train?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.24,0:06:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mwell unfortunately,\Nit's bound for Enies Lobby,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.82,0:06:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,which is only accessible\Nto government personnel.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even the engine driver works for the\Ngovernment.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I have no say in this matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.27,0:06:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess our only choice\Nis to head to the station
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and try to talk\Nsome sense into Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you which direction\NLuffy and Zoro flew off in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so you go search there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you find them,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.40,0:06:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tell them to come to the\Nstation as quickly as they can!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.23,0:06:48.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.94,0:06:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.94,0:06:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen up.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.08,0:06:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie's okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See that girl over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to help her find her buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.06,0:07:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure that smoke didn't\Nget to your brain, Paulie?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.29,0:07:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are the guys that\Ntried to kill Mister Iceburg.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.56,0:07:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should wring their\Nno-good-sorry necks!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, why should we waste\Nour time helping some criminals
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when Lucci and Kaku\Nare still missing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats aren't the ones who did it,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real criminals set them up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.26,0:07:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't been so damn blind,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.76,0:07:21.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be in this\Nsituation right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.72,0:07:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know the real identity\Nof those guys in the masks
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I do know\Nthat the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tried to protect us from them.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.26,0:07:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, Iceburg\Nand I wouldn't even be alive
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.26,0:07:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,right now if it\Nwasn't for their help.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.86,0:07:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't bother looking for\NLucci and Kaku there's no point.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, I don't know if we'll ever be\Nseeing them again.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you know what\Nhappened to the foremen,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.91,0:07:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then you gotta tell us, Paulie!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.36,0:07:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They went back home.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.54,0:07:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would they do\Nthat at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.25,0:07:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and go find Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, immoral girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? You're still\Ncalling me that?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.01,0:08:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're going to the station,\NI'll show you the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.41,0:08:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold a sec, Paulie!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that stuff you told us true?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.98,0:08:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit yer yapping and\Nhelp them out already!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.68,0:08:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making Galley-La look bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.63,0:08:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.60,0:08:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.66,0:08:16.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.56,0:08:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll help any way we can!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.85,0:08:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open the cage!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring out the yagaras!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.38,0:08:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Went back home," did they?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I spared 'em the details.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's better that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was bad enough when we found out.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.00,0:08:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They deserve the truth but\NI don't wanna hurt those guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.39,0:08:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Guys! Can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.55,0:09:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.22,0:09:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}Usopp, you can come with us too,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.29,0:09:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now shout it with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right buddy, you\Ngot it. Let's do it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.90,0:09:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.28,0:09:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}Usopp,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}you can come with us too.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.08,0:09:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take that canal over\Non the left-hand side.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shortcut to the station!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.98,0:09:43.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We still have 20 minutes\Nbefore the train leaves.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.21,0:09:45.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.88,0:09:48.35,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to sacrifice yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We can save you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.85,0:09:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yagara, you think you can\Ngo a little bit faster, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The 11 o' clock train\Nis about to depart.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.30,0:10:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All passengers going from\NBlue Station to Enies Lobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,please board immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.51,0:10:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear another\Nword out of you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.28,0:10:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well maybe I wouldn't\Ncomplain so much
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you weren't\Nsuch big jerkwads!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.45,0:10:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah you big jerkwads!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.98,0:10:26.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come\Nover here and fight?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.38,0:10:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Due to the approaching storm\Nsurge, the departure time
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has been moved up and the\Ntrain will be departing shortly.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.68,0:10:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this was\Nbad enough already.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.08,0:10:42.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all these years,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.95,0:10:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our mission has\Nfinally come to an end.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.26,0:10:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not there yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.57,0:10:47.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop spouting nonsense
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and take your mission\Nseriously, you fool.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.86,0:10:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(23,63,\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&H78&)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(23,357,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}You can't sail in this weather.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.73,0:11:00.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(23,63,\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&H78&)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(23,357,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}Unless you can catch that train,\Nyou won't be able to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.30,0:11:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.27,0:11:03.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're so close!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.35,0:11:19.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, wherever you\Nare I hope you're safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.80,0:11:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.66,0:11:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.83,0:11:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.60,0:11:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.57,0:11:37.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.54,0:11:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.34,0:11:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's not much time!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.37,0:11:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}Usopp, you can come too.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.91,0:11:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.18,0:11:51.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys're gonna\Ntake Robin away!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need your help!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.43,0:12:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how the rest of the\Ncrew is dealing with this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.32,0:12:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, time's up. They'll\Nhave to catch me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat: the final train will\Nbe departing ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please board immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,399)}You bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.34,0:12:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,396)}I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.83,0:12:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,396)}Just wait, you'll see!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once I get out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.62,0:12:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One little slip-up,\Nthen this crap happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.12,0:12:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you bastards.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.48,0:12:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once I get out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.17,0:12:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.75,0:12:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.20,0:12:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.57,0:13:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.11,0:13:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta save Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.64,0:13:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.60,0:13:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.10,0:13:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.\NWhere in the heck are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.07,0:13:18.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have we checked over there yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess they're not here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has anybody checked\Nover in the backstreets yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if we can.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.04,0:13:30.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're probably completely flooded by\Nnow.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'd be too dangerous to look for them\Nthere.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.48,0:13:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.08,0:13:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.03,0:13:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.96,0:13:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves are getting\Ndangerously high,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.73,0:13:50.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we've decided to depart\Nearly as a safety measure.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.33,0:13:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's any trouble, we could...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.93,0:13:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.70,0:13:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.43,0:13:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coo coo!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.34,0:13:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We lived here for five years
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.71,0:14:05.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but even as we leave I don't\Nfeel nostalgic in the least.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.97,0:14:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, was that a\Nsteam whistle just now?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it was, that means\Nthe train is running
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.57,0:14:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nearly fifteen minutes\Nahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.55,0:14:31.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're probably\Ntaking off early,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.78,0:14:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause the weather's\Ngetting bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government runs that line,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.52,0:14:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they can leave\Nwhenever they want!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.76,0:14:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.76,0:14:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The station's right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, train!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't leave yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Attention, tonight's final\Ndeparture, heading from
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Water Seven to Enies Lobby\Nis now leaving the station.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.55,0:14:58.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard her.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sit down already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.29,0:15:08.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(17,58,\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&H78&)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(17,434,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}I wanted nothing more than to die at that\Nvery moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2483,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}But you forced me to live.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.26,0:15:12.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2483,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}That's your crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.35,0:15:20.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(16,58,\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&H78&)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(16,433,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}I'm afraid there's no place left for me to\Ngo or return to.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.47,0:15:23.49,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So I've decided to stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:24.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I see your problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,guess there's no\Nother choice, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:27.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:28.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Luffy!\N– Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.83,0:15:30.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2229,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}She isn't a bad person.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2229,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Trust me, okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.76,0:15:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think we're moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid government jerkwads.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good job, Mr. Yagara!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.97,0:16:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go down the stairs through the middle\Nentrance!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.14,0:16:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.11,0:16:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you\NRobin, please don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.17,0:16:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.03,0:16:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.73,0:16:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.21,0:16:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, get off that train!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you're\Nup against. We'll help you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.26,0:16:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.97,0:16:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't move.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.78,0:16:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.29,0:16:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.80,0:17:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.75,0:17:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.91,0:17:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we were too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.05,0:17:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:39.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.69,0:17:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that guy\Ntrying to pull, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, it really doesn't\Nmatter.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.39,0:17:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a Government train.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be captured, and\Nthat will be the end of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.50,0:17:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't he with Galley-La?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.98,0:17:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Paulie!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.48,0:18:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try to act professional, will ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.65,0:18:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's something going on\Nbetween them.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.42,0:18:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a train station!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.85,0:18:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People say hello and\Ngoodbye here every day!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's our responsibility\Nas employees here
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.69,0:18:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to silently oversee\Nthings like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.73,0:18:15.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.27,0:18:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.97,0:18:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.67,0:18:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quiet. Got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Train left a little early, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.52,0:18:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes! That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the passengers\Nwere already on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:29.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they decided to...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.49,0:18:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weather's getting\Nrougher by the minute, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.50,0:18:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, Aqua Laguna could hit at any\Nmoment!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.50,0:18:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With all of these factors\Nin mind, it was decided
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that the departure time\Nshould be pushed forward!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.52,0:18:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.36,0:18:44.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should take shelter\Non the Shipbuilding Island
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.27,0:18:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey listen, the train's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.34,0:18:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do to stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.35,0:18:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Enies Lobby isn't the\Nkind of place where...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look I-I understand\Nhow you must feel, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.70,0:19:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.05,0:19:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's pissed!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.15,0:19:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive those\NWorld Government idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.39,0:19:14.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, I need a ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.11,0:19:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.77,0:19:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The strongest and fastest you've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.72,0:19:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna set sail in\Nthe middle of all this?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.49,0:19:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.03,0:19:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how dangerous this\Nstorm is?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.83,0:19:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lay off!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.26,0:19:26.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can handle it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.39,0:19:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, this isn't some\Nregular run-of-the-mill storm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're talking about!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's about to be hell at sea around here!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to sail out now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.36,0:19:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doing so is nothing short of a death wish!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.60,0:19:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.86,0:19:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin is throwing her life away\Nfor our sake and I'm not gonna...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.61,0:20:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.65,0:20:15.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.72,0:20:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saved us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.79,0:20:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we would've all been\Nswept out into the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.89,0:20:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.16,0:20:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That huge fixture with the train schedule\Non it was torn apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing like that has ever happened here\Nbefore.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.83,0:20:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even with Aqua Laguna.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.03,0:20:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This thing's power is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.96,0:20:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the actual storm\Nisn't even here yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.13,0:20:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is different this year.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.87,0:20:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These waves are coming in fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.34,0:20:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that sea train that they took\NRobin on in any danger?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.25,0:20:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It should be able to make\Nit out of this rough patch
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.55,0:20:56.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before the actual\Nstorm makes landfall.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.22,0:20:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless it takes a direct hit,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.95,0:21:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that train's capable of cutting\Nthrough these big waves.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.81,0:21:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.92,0:21:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.69,0:21:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.79,0:21:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone left you a note out in front of\Nthe station.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.22,0:21:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must've been one\Nof your crewmates.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.72,0:21:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A note?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.31,0:21:13.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From who?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.44,0:21:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And how did you manage to notice something\Nso small?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was right here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.20,0:21:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoever it was made it easy for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.34,0:21:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That dimwit!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.14,0:21:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, what does it say?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.42,0:21:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first half is just a hopeless love\Nletter.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did she say "love letter"?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.36,0:21:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems there's a love triangle going on\Nhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.36,0:21:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.03,0:21:42.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Considering the situation,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.06,0:21:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd say the other\Nman is most likely...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.04,0:21:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The important part starts here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.00,0:21:57.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,P.S. I saw Robin get on\Nthe 11 o'clock train.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.61,0:22:01.68,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hop on board and follow her.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.76,0:22:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji got on board that train?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp's there, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.79,0:22:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"And some arrogant thug with\Na ducktail." Who's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That must be Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.31,0:22:13.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, must be.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She mentioned another man!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.80,0:22:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it sounds like Franky, of\Nall people, must be the fifth!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.34,0:22:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poor Paulie doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.03,0:22:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'd be better if he just threw in\Nthe towel.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.91,0:22:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell\Nis with you guys?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.82,0:22:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's something else.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.39,0:22:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was left on the ground alongside that\Nletter.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.80,0:22:36.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There should be at least\None transponder snail
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.74,0:22:38.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,somewhere on that sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.67,0:22:40.38,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll contact you as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.71,0:22:46.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep this portable one close to you at all\Ntimes, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:47.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Just pretend it's me
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.89,0:22:50.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and hold it lovingly against\Nyour soft, beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.81,0:22:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.74,0:22:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He left this one to communicate with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.21,0:22:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.21,0:22:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must have anticipated Nico Robin's\Nmovements.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.28,0:23:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll say!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.15,0:23:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least for the time being, Robin has\NSanji with her.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.19,0:23:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of us will\Njust have to catch up
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.94,0:23:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with them at Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.14,0:23:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, can't even manage to light up a\Nsingle smoke out here.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.30,0:23:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So after that, Sanji went to the train\Nstation?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.01,0:23:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.02,0:23:35.05,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,And Usopp's on\Nthe train with him!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.11,0:23:36.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.92,0:23:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, no matter how\Nwe're going to follow them,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.30,0:23:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can't do anything until\Nwe find Luffy and Zoro first!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.24,0:23:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.70,0:23:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.90,0:23:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a hundred percent certain\Nabout which way they flew
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.06,0:23:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so head in that direction\Nand start looking!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.80,0:23:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys help look, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.24,0:23:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.80,0:23:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.90,0:23:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.80,0:23:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't let you down!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.41,0:24:10.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, what would be the best way
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.32,0:24:12.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for one to sneak\Ninside this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.29,0:24:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.12,0:24:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This storm is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.73,0:24:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,233)}Collier Shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.86,0:24:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who in the hell are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.79,0:24:36.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.83,0:24:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.82,0:24:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.05,0:24:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did you see that kick?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.79,0:24:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not some\Nrun-of-the-mill civilian!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.06,0:24:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.00,0:24:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you keep saying\Nthings like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.41,0:24:59.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I'll blush.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.74,0:25:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a compliment!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.34,0:25:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's making fun of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.05,0:25:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go let Rob Lucci know
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.68,0:25:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that we've got a suspicious\Nintruder on board!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.28,0:25:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.42,0:25:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This insignificant little\Nmatter isn't something
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we need to bother CP9 with.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.71,0:25:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how violent\Nor unruly this man is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.02,0:25:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it won't do him any good.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.72,0:25:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because, in this car, you've\Ngot... Whoa, it's smoky!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.34,0:25:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In this car, you've got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jerry!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.07,0:25:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.44,0:25:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're looking at the champion\Non a South Blue island
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.92,0:25:42.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,renowned for its martial arts.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.16,0:25:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The undefeated Boxing Champion!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.96,0:25:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I prefer karate.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.13,0:25:54.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can handle my punches\Nthen maybe I'll show you some!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.90,0:25:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.00,0:25:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need to overdo it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:26:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jerry Aurora Flicker!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.16,0:26:03.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jerry!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.86,0:26:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your target's behind you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.20,0:26:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a sneaky one!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.96,0:26:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.91,0:26:11.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't think you have me\Nat a disadvantage just
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.88,0:26:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because I'm so very tall and\Nthis train car is so very tiny!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.32,0:26:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the first time\NI've ever talked to someone
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.92,0:26:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,whose head is where\Ntheir crotch should be.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.00,0:26:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My boxing technique\Nis more effective
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.46,0:26:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in tight places like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare for annihilation!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.49,0:26:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Yoga Style!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.93,0:26:28.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One-two!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.93,0:26:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just shortened your reach!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.86,0:26:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what you think!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.99,0:26:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.42,0:26:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Screw!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Drop Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.30,0:26:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's totally against\Nevery single rule of boxing!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.80,0:26:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.50,0:26:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Brochette!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.61,0:27:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll start with the seventh and last car.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.81,0:27:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the World Government\Nofficials are there.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.38,0:27:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In order of increasing strength,\Nthe fifth car is next.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.42,0:27:12.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That car holds 40 marines\Nand the man who leads them,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.09,0:27:16.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a Navy Headquarters Captain\Nand former knight named T-Bone.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.68,0:27:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next, in the 4th car,\Nwe have Wanze,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.94,0:27:21.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,an accomplished martial artist\Nfrom Cipher Pol number 7
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.09,0:27:25.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who also happens to be\Nthe head steward on this trip.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.06,0:27:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Standing by in the 3rd car is\NNero, the newest member of CP9,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.80,0:27:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, though we\Nare escorting criminals,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with government personnel\Nas trained and powerful
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.75,0:27:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as the ones I mentioned,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.82,0:27:52.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we needn't worry about\Nthe possibility of a raid.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.62,0:27:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our military might
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.72,0:27:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is represented\Nthroughout this train.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.83,0:28:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.13,0:28:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.03,0:28:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here to help!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.04,0:28:06.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.46,0:28:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.62,0:28:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mister Foreman, it must be\Nhard for you to even move.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.82,0:28:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should take a little break.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.05,0:28:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.96,0:28:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.86,0:28:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and find them!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.03,0:28:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.29,0:28:21.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has anyone gone to\Nbring Iceburg up to speed?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.72,0:28:24.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two men went to\Ngive him a report!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.40,0:28:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you\Ngoing, Mr. Iceburg?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.18,0:28:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.64,0:28:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.76,0:28:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.98,0:28:41.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer us, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.58,0:28:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.26,0:28:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.42,0:28:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on guys, answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.79,0:28:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.83,0:28:52.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.37,0:28:53.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Food, you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.24,0:28:54.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.08,0:28:54.75,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We need meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.79,0:28:55.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2651,3652,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}All the meat you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:56.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2651,3652,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}And hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.76,0:28:59.93,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2651,3652,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.96,0:29:02.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did we end up being a couple\Nof errand boys for that girl?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.90,0:29:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not doing this for her!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.87,0:29:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doing it for Paulie!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.45,0:29:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's so devoted to\Nthat crazy woman,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.89,0:29:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even after she dumped him!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.07,0:29:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gotta give this our all!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.64,0:29:10.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.52,0:29:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.72,0:29:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, she\Nmust be really hungry!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.59,0:29:16.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's still a growing girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.79,0:29:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.59,0:29:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.83,0:29:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.54,0:29:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.66,0:29:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.60,0:29:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The strong winds are\Nalready interfering
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.13,0:29:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with my sense of smell.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.41,0:29:50.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.35,0:29:52.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels like we've been\Ncalling for hours,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.42,0:29:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's still no answer.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.09,0:29:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think that maybe they're...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.10,0:29:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just keep trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:01.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.81,0:30:04.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Where in the world are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.24,0:30:06.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way that leopard guy took you\Nout.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.01,0:30:10.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We finally know\Nwhy Robin left us
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.06,0:30:12.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and we need to do\Nsomething about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.39,0:30:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.95,0:30:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer us!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.16,0:30:22.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.33,0:30:23.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the rest of us
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.28,0:30:25.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,are coming to save\Nyou no matter what!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.53,0:30:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.66,0:30:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Paulie!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.10,0:30:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick, come see for yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.57,0:30:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The more the tide recedes,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.01,0:30:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the bigger the\Nreturning waves will be.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.61,0:30:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you pay attention\Nto the ebb of the tide,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.18,0:30:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can measure the\Nmagnitude of the storm surge.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.18,0:30:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.24,0:30:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.47,0:31:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And, if you\Nconsider how much lower
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.47,0:31:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the water level's\Ngoing to be this year.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.70,0:31:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chimney!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.40,0:31:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.71,0:31:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.41,0:31:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.97,0:31:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meow! Meow! Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.52,0:31:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if the sea has dried up.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.39,0:31:28.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen anything like this in my\Nentire life.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:28.30,0:31:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The power of the sea is astonishing.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.13,0:31:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.36,0:31:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can the tide be so low?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.63,0:31:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\Nanything like it!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.54,0:31:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how big of a wave\Nis coming this time?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.41,0:31:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the backstreets are going\Nto be completely swallowed up!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.48,0:31:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope nobody's still down there.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.25,0:31:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there is,\Nthey'll die instantly!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.88,0:32:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The roar of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.05,0:32:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.58,0:32:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look-ee, look-ee,\Nlook-ee, look-ee, look-ee!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:10.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.12,0:32:11.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Granny!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.05,0:32:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a look over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.98,0:32:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see something!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.38,0:32:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.72,0:32:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.72,0:32:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something between those two\Nbuildings!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.56,0:32:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, Granny!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:20.89,0:32:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:24.30,0:32:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.01,0:32:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.74,0:32:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it isn't the pirate girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:29.11,0:32:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:29.93,0:32:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss Pirate Lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.40,0:32:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.92,0:32:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:33.08,0:32:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see something!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.52,0:32:37.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.76,0:32:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just what are you going on about,\NChimney?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:41.09,0:32:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.49,0:32:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to the sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dried up!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.29,0:32:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.33,0:32:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That straw hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.96,0:33:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that your "King\Nof the Pirates" captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:02.99,0:33:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.53,0:33:08.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.70,0:33:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:11.73,0:33:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.37,0:33:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go down\Nto the back streets!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:14.70,0:33:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.68,0:33:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying\Nto kill yourself?!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.35,0:33:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is gonna hit\Nat any moment! Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:25.01,0:33:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirate girl went down the stairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:26.95,0:33:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.62,0:33:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.35,0:33:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if another wave hits?!
